  "intended_meaning": "Ask a gate guard the requirement to pass the gate.",
  "generation_attempt_1": "\"I'm afraid I can't give you a simple answer,\" the gate guard says, eyes flicking toward the crowded line and the notice board listing curfews and taxes. \"The rules for passage vary, and travelers might be required to show permits, pay certain fees, or prove they're not a threat. These days, with the Ash Compact census and tightened checks, things can change on short notice. Your best bet is to prepare for paperwork and coin, but exactly what depends on who’s watching and what happens to be in force when you reach the front.\"",
